#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:9
msgid "Internal Appliance URL (PXE)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:10
msgid ""
"For PXE-Boot your appliance needs to be routable directly with minimal "
"NAT masquerading. This allows one to override the default appliance url "
"endpoint for use by the PXE Server. If this is unset, the default "
"appliance url will be used instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:11
msgid "API Allowed Origins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:12
msgid ""
"A CORS-related field which specifies the origins that are allowed to "
"access the |morpheus| API. For example, if you were designing a web "
"application which needed to make AJAX calls to |morpheus| API. The "
"origins should be specified here. By default, all origins are allowed. "
"When this field is filled, an exclusive whitelist of allowed origins is "
"established."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:13
msgid "Cloud Sync Interval"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:14
msgid ""
"Data is refreshed through cloud integrations at the interval specified "
"here in seconds, the default value is 300 seconds (five minutes). "
"Appliances managing a very large number of clouds may be adversely "
"affected by setting this value too low."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:15
msgid "Usage Retainment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:16
msgid ""
"Determines how many days to keep account usage (metered costing data) "
"records. Retainment period is not set by default. Usage records will "
"remain indefinitely if Usage Retainment is not set. Note this does not "
"affect generated Invoice records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:17
msgid "Incident Retainment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:18
msgid ""
"Enter the number of days |morpheus| should keep incident records in the "
"database. In general, this setting can be left alone but in certain cases"
" may need to be adjusted as very large incident database tables can "
"affect the stability of the application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:19
msgid "Stats Retainment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:20
msgid ""
"Select 30, 60 or 90 days period for stats retainment. Selecting a larger "
"period gives the ability to analyze stats, such as Instance metrics, over"
" a longer period of time. For example, in the Monitoring tab of an "
"Instance detail page, users can select a 60 or 90-day analysis period if "
"the stats have been retained that long"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:21
msgid "Denied Hosts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:22
msgid ""
"A comma-delimited list of IP addresses and/or hostnames which should not "
"be allowed sources for HTTP Tasks or REST-populated Option Lists."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:23
msgid "Approved Hosts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:24
msgid ""
"A comma-delimited list of IP addresses and/or hostnames which are the "
"only approved sources for HTTP Tasks or REST-populated Option Lists. By "
"entering any values here, all others are automatically denied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:25
msgid "Enable SSL Verification of Agent (Communications)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:26
msgid ""
"Enabling SSL Verification of Agent Communications requires a valid "
"Certificate be installed on the Appliance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:27
msgid "Disable SSH Password Authentication"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:28
msgid ""
"Only allow ssh login using SSH keys. When true, SSH Password "
"Authentication will not be enabled for VM's and Hosts provisioned after "
"the setting is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:29
msgid "Default Appliance Locale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:30
msgid ""
"Sets the default language and region for all users on the |morpheus| "
"appliance. Users with individual language preferences may also override "
"this selection on their User Settings page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:31
msgid "Default Console Gateway"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:32
msgid ""
"Select a configured VDI Gateway to route Instance and Host console "
"sessions. The gateway can use the same Worker runtime as a Distributed "
"Worker, but it requires a VDI Gateway registration and API key. See "
":doc:`/administration/integrations/workers` and :ref:`vdi-gateways`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:33
msgid "Max Option List Size"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:34
msgid ""
"Sets a maximum size for Option Lists (such as those sourced from REST "
"calls to a remote server) to preserve appliance performance in the event "
"that a very large payload is inadvertently accessed. The entered number "
"is multiplied by 1000 (for example, entering \"1\" results in a maximum "
"list size of 1000)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:35
msgid "Dashboards to Display"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/appliance.rst:36
msgid ""
"A typeahead field which will show all Dashboards available to the "
"appliance from Dashboard-type plugins. Select all desired Dashboards and "
"they will be displayed in the order set. Dashboards can be dragged up and"
" down the list to set the order correctly."
msgstr ""

